{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower of Eden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike where you play as Izaak. A man with a unique curse on a quest to take down the Astrian King and his court.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/P1.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become adept at using different weapons and strategies as you battle your way past the closest of the king\u2019s advisors to the king\u2019s chambers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Shop.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each attempt, grow stronger and learn the horrific machinations behind the scenes that led to Astra\u2019s greatest tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Combat.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice of Astra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Izaak can\u2019t do this alone. In between attempts interact with the other Astrians who also struggle under King Eden\u2019s rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Church.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you befriend and aid them, they will arm you with resources to improve your strategy. With a variety of upgrades to help ease your journey, they might just be the allies you need to get to Eden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Academy.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/AbilityReset.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic turn based combat with a modest twist. Some of your abilities aren\u2019t readily available as they are randomly assigned each turn. Being able to strategize and pivot on the fly when fighting through the Tower\u00a0is key to succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/F1UR.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the domain of each member of the court, each with unique creatures, challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique experience every run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large amount of customizability and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous art and music by talented artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fun story that unravels with every climb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369700?t=1745328253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/f48b633116a5a74b90bb0d6ccb132bfebfa2be6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745328253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/13725e7c49db7d908e844a7c5215e9c7c1319b89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745328253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/13725e7c49db7d908e844a7c5215e9c7c1319b89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745328253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3652010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower of Eden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike where you play as Izaak. A man with a unique curse on a quest to take down the Astrian King and his court.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/P1.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become adept at using different weapons and strategies as you battle your way past the closest of the king\u2019s advisors to the king\u2019s chambers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Shop.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each attempt, grow stronger and learn the horrific machinations behind the scenes that led to Astra\u2019s greatest tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Combat.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice of Astra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Izaak can\u2019t do this alone. In between attempts interact with the other Astrians who also struggle under King Eden\u2019s rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Church.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you befriend and aid them, they will arm you with resources to improve your strategy. With a variety of upgrades to help ease your journey, they might just be the allies you need to get to Eden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/Academy.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/AbilityReset.gif?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic turn based combat with a modest twist. Some of your abilities aren\u2019t readily available as they are randomly assigned each turn. Being able to strategize and pivot on the fly when fighting through the Tower\u00a0is key to succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/F1UR.png?t=1745328253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the domain of each member of the court, each with unique creatures, challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique experience every run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large amount of customizability and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous art and music by talented artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fun story that unravels with every climb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chris-Emio Raymond"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/66f4f4b38f4c033014a92bef7cba82c56a8a0680/header.jpg?t=1745328253","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123110,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123110/movie480.mp4?t=1744040624","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123110/movie_max.mp4?t=1744040624